sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant REST as MLServer REST<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as MLServer gRPC<br/>8081/TCP h2c
    participant DP as DataPlane Handler
    participant MM as Model Manager
    participant RT as Model Runtime<br/>(in-process Python)
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>8082/TCP HTTP
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over Client,RT: Flow 1: Synchronous REST Inference
    Client->>KRBAC: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (OpenShift OAuth)
    KRBAC->>KRBAC: Validate token
    KRBAC->>REST: HTTP/8080 (localhost, validated)
    REST->>DP: Route to DataPlane
    DP->>MM: Resolve model
    MM->>RT: Execute predict()
    RT-->>MM: InferenceResponse
    MM-->>DP: Result
    DP-->>REST: JSON response
    REST-->>KRBAC: HTTP 200
    KRBAC-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Client,RT: Flow 2: Synchronous gRPC Inference
    Client->>KRBAC: ModelInfer RPC<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (gRPC metadata)
    KRBAC->>GRPC: gRPC/8081 (localhost, validated)
    GRPC->>DP: Route to DataPlane
    DP->>MM: Resolve model
    MM->>RT: Execute predict()
    RT-->>MM: InferenceResponse
    MM-->>DP: Result
    DP-->>GRPC: Protobuf response
    GRPC-->>KRBAC: gRPC response
    KRBAC-->>Client: gRPC over TLS response

    Note over Client,RT: Flow 3: Streaming REST Inference (SSE)
    Client->>KRBAC: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer_stream<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>REST: HTTP/8080 (localhost, validated)
    REST->>DP: Route to DataPlane
    DP->>MM: Resolve model
    MM->>RT: Execute predict_stream()
    loop Streaming chunks
        RT-->>MM: Partial result (async iterator)
        MM-->>DP: Chunk
        DP-->>REST: SSE event
        REST-->>KRBAC: SSE chunk
        KRBAC-->>Client: SSE chunk (HTTPS)
    end

    Note over Prom,Metrics: Metrics Collection
    Prom->>Metrics: GET /metrics (HTTP/8082)
    Metrics-->>Prom: Prometheus exposition format
